From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:03:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] The land's trees' stumps drawn as the game draws them,
 their painted patch included (SDK_PORT_3DS)

With the sun shadows a tree's stump was sent marked 0x40000002
(NITRO_GX3D_TAG_STUMP) and drawn without the dark patch the game paints
round it. At a forest's edge that patch is what hides the lowest leaves
of the tree behind: without it they showed under each tree as loose
pieces (on a 3DS, the meteor area by Veilstone, 2026-11-12). The stumps
are sent unmarked now, as the game draws them; the trees' sun shadows are
laid as before. How a tree meets the ground is to be worked out again.
---
 src/overlay005/land_data.c | 12 +++++++-----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/overlay005/land_data.c b/src/overlay005/land_data.c
index 03e251da..cc8ff38d 100644
--- a/src/overlay005/land_data.c
+++ b/src/overlay005/land_data.c
@@ -49,9 +49,11 @@ extern int NitroPort_WideScreenExtra(void);
 // again as the sun moves on). From then on a tree shape is sent as: its
 // layers (their far side from the sun shaded: marked 0x40000004,
 // NITRO_GX3D_TAG_CANOPY, a COLOR before each vertex what its lit colour
-// is times); its stumps marked 0x40000002 (NITRO_GX3D_TAG_STUMP: drawn
-// without the dark patch round them, the game's own shadow under the
-// tree); its shadows marked 0x40000000 (NITRO_GX3D_TAG_SHADE: drawn as
+// is times); its stumps as the game draws them, the dark patch painted
+// round them included (2026-11-12: drawn without it, marked 0x40000002,
+// NITRO_GX3D_TAG_STUMP, a forest's edge showed the lowest leaves of the
+// trees behind as loose pieces; how a tree meets the ground is to be
+// worked out again); its shadows marked 0x40000000 (NITRO_GX3D_TAG_SHADE: drawn as
 // the sun shadows are); what the shape's own list leaves set. The shadows
 // are polygons like any others to the 3D: nothing is worked out for them
 // each scene.
@@ -297,7 +299,7 @@ static void Port_LandTreeShape(NNSG3dRS *rs)
     if (list != NULL) {
         Port_LandTreeParts(0x40000004, slot->made, k, 0);
         list = NitroPort_Gx3dTreeStumps(slot->made, k, &bytes);
-        Port_LandTreeList(0x40000002, list, bytes);
+        Port_LandTreeList(0, list, bytes);
     } else {
         list = NitroPort_Gx3dTreeCanopies(slot->made, k, &bytes);
 
@@ -308,7 +310,7 @@ static void Port_LandTreeShape(NNSG3dRS *rs)
             }
 
             list = NitroPort_Gx3dTreeStumps(slot->made, k, &bytes);
-            Port_LandTreeList(0x40000002, list, bytes);
+            Port_LandTreeList(0, list, bytes);
         } else {
             NNS_G3dGeSendDL(NNS_G3dGetShpDLPtr(shp), NNS_G3dGetShpDLSize(shp));
         }
